# ==============================================================================
#                      KRITAGAS PROJECT ROOT ENVIRONMENT GUIDE
# ==============================================================================
# The KRITAGAS repository consists of two primary services:
# 1. Backend (FastAPI + PostgreSQL / Neon + Valkey Cache + AI Pipeline):
#    - Configuration template: backend/.env.example
#    - Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env and fill in your credentials.
#
# 2. Frontend (Next.js 15 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind CSS):
#    - Configuration template: frontend/.env.example
#    - Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env.local and configure NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL.
#
# NEVER commit real .env or secret keys into version control!
# ==============================================================================
